        "calls": 1,
        "title": "Muse Spark 1.3 open to full access, plan-only at limited access",
        "summary": "The shared model catalog in the `common` package moves `meta/muse-spark-1.3-contributor` from the globally paid-only lists (`FREEBUFF_PRO_ONLY_CATALOG_MODEL_IDS`) to the limited-tier plan-only list (`FREEBUFF_LIMITED_TIER_PLAN_ONLY_MODEL_IDS`), making it open to every full-access account without a plan while remaining plan-gated at limited access. The model row's `newBadge` tooltip is updated to state that it is free to open for full-access accounts and that a paid plan unlocks it where access is limited. Muse Spark 1.2 is excluded from the limited plan-only set, so it is not offered at limited access even with a plan.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "end-users",
        "evidence": "The diff in `common/src/constants/freebuff-models.ts` removes `FREEBUFF_MUSE_SPARK_13_CONTRIBUTOR_MODEL_ID` from `FREEBUFF_PRO_ONLY_CATALOG_MODEL_IDS` and `FREEBUFF_PRO_ONLY_EVERY_SURFACE_MODEL_IDS`, and adds it to `FREEBUFF_LIMITED_TIER_PLAN_ONLY_MODEL_IDS` with a comment stating it is open to every full-access account and plan-only at limited access. The `MUSE_SPARK_13_CONTRIBUTOR_MODEL` row's `newBadge` tooltip is updated to reflect this entitlement.",
        "userVisible": true,
        "confidence": "medium",
        "unknowns": "The diff does not show the 15 Freebucks price value, which is noted in the summary as metered in Freebucks but not defined in the changed files.",
